# =============================================================================
# Copy to .env or .env.local as needed (Vite only — see below).
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vite (browser) — optional .env.local
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only VITE_* names are exposed to the browser. Do not put secrets in VITE_*.
#
# Optional: full URL to a MapLibre-compatible style JSON (vector/raster per provider licence).
# Defaults to Carto Positron when unset. Mapbox mapbox:// styles require Mapbox GL, not MapLibre.
# VITE_MAPLIBRE_STYLE_URL=

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lambda / SAM local — NOT read from this file
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Put TfL, ORS, Mapbox tokens, UKHPI_LIVE, API_SECRETS_ARN in:
#   sam/env.json          (required for npm run sam:local — copy from sam/env.json.example)
#   sam/env.local.json    (optional overrides; gitignored)
#
# See sam/README.md and docs/infrastructure/aws-sam.md

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AWS SAM deploy — not read from .env by sam local; use sam deploy / console
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# template.yaml Parameters → Lambda env where noted:
#   TflAppKey              → TFL_APP_KEY (SearchAreasFunction)
#   OrsApiKey              → ORS_API_KEY (SearchAreasFunction)
#   SearchAreasRoutingStrict → SEARCH_AREAS_ROUTING_STRICT (SAM local only: '1' = require keys; deployed Lambdas always enforce)
#   MapboxAccessToken      → MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN (GeocodeWorkplaceFunction)
#   CorsAdditionalOrigin   → API Gateway CORS only (extra browser origin; localhost:5173 always allowed)
#   ApiSecretsArn          → Secrets Manager ARN (JSON: TFL_APP_KEY, ORS_API_KEY, MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN). IAM policy attached when non-empty.
#
# Example:
#   sam deploy --parameter-overrides TflAppKey=... OrsApiKey=... MapboxAccessToken=... CorsAdditionalOrigin=https://your-site.example ApiSecretsArn=arn:aws:secretsmanager:...
